  "helpFaqHeading": "Frequently asked questions",
  "helpFaq1Q": "How long does profile verification take?",
  "helpFaq1A": "Once you submit your details and documents, our team reviews them and verifies your account. You can check your status anytime from \"Application under review\" — it updates as soon as you're approved.",
  "helpFaq2Q": "How do I go online for jobs?",
  "helpFaq2A": "Once verified, open the Jobs tab and toggle yourself online. New job requests in your service category and area will start showing up there.",
  "helpFaq3Q": "How is my earnings total calculated?",
  "helpFaq3A": "The Earnings screen totals the value of every job you've marked Completed, split by today / this week / this month. It reads directly from your completed job history — nothing is estimated.",
  "helpFaq4Q": "How do I get paid?",
  "helpFaq4A": "Payouts are settled to the bank account and IFSC you provided under Financial details. Make sure those stay accurate — you can update them anytime from Edit profile.",
  "helpFaq5Q": "The map or navigation isn't working on a job.",
  "helpFaq5A": "Navigate opens the job's address in Google Maps. Make sure location permission is granted to the app and you have a network connection — the on-screen map also needs a data connection to load.",
  "helpFaq6Q": "I need to change my category, city, or documents.",
  "helpFaq6A": "Go to My profile → Edit profile. You can update your details and documents there; changes are saved to your account immediately.",
